Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["FORM and TFORM scaling", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"5c11bb02-b8d1-418b-a8b4-76abe786d88e"],

Cell["Which worker count helps on this machine?", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"2e54e1ca-9c4c-49c1-8473-55f42341f3a5"],

Cell["\<\
Each workload is exported once. Serial FORM and available TFORM \
configurations are run sequentially in alternating order. Every successful \
output is imported and compared outside execution timing. Full includes the \
complete bubble.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"32e8a1a1-f223-47e5-9c12-424a216e569f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4a40c14a-9d1e-4592-99c3-3def7e5d9329"],

Cell["\<\
Use a fresh kernel for reproducible measurements. Mathematica, FeynGrav with \
FeynCalc, and FORM/TFORM are sufficient. No Python, shell scripts or external \
fixtures are needed. Opening this notebook does not execute any cells.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97c0a399-b523-4005-ac3f-534d6f108e3a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

